2026-08-29  stevensko <skovraneksteven@gmail.com>

	* Fork of vcsh, rebranded as "Homerooms Dotfiles Manager"
	* Command renamed vcsh -> room
	* Environment variables renamed VCSH_* -> HOMEROOMS_*
	* Config flattened to $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/homerooms/ -- repositories,
	  <repo>.room configs, hooks-enabled/, overlays-enabled/, config and
	  the manifest all live directly in it; no repo.d/ or wrapper dir
	* System config: /etc/vcsh/config -> /etc/homerooms/config
	* Source script renamed vcsh.in -> homerooms.in; man page vcsh.1 -> room.1
	* Per-repo config is $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/homerooms/<repo>.room (was
	  config.d/<repo>); delete/rename now keep the .room file in sync
	* New: `room manifest [<file>]` writes name/url/branch for every repo
	  with an origin remote (default $HOMEROOMS_MANIFEST, '-' for stdout)
	* New: `room restore [<file>]` clones every repo listed in a manifest
	  that is not already present -- built-in bootstrap, no myrepos/gita
	* delete: use `git ls-files -z | xargs -0` so paths with whitespace,
	  glob characters, or non-ASCII bytes are removed correctly
	* Drop the myrepos (post-init-setup-mr) sample hook; bootstrap is
	  now built in via manifest/restore
	* Add install-local.sh for a no-autotools user-space install

